course: dictionary
lesson: 7428
title: What is a politician?
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A politician is a person whose job is politics. Many politicians are elected, which means people vote for them to run a town, a region or a country. A mayor, a senator and a member of parliament are all politicians. «Each politician picked the part that suited them.» Here the sentence shows politicians making choices.
explain: The word can also be used in a negative way. Some people call someone a politician when they are clever at getting what they want by managing other people. Read the clues in the sentence to see which meaning is meant. If it is about voting, running a town or making laws, it is the job meaning.
explain: Try a check. Swap in another word: «Politicians use jokes too» could say «Mayors use jokes too» and still make sense, so politician means a person in the job of politics. Politicians is the plural, which means more than one.
fact: A politician is a person whose job is in politics.
fact: Mayors, senators and members of parliament are all examples of politicians.
fact: Politicians are often elected, which means people vote for them.
fact: «Politicians» is the plural, meaning more than one politician.
fact: Sometimes «politician» is used in a negative way, to mean someone who is clever at getting what they want by managing people.
exercise: A mayor who is elected to run a town is what kind of person? | *A politician | A chef | A pilot | A ship captain
exercise: Find and copy the plural word in this sentence: «Politicians use jokes too, and many have social media teams.» | social | teams | jokes | *Politicians
exercise: Someone says, «She is a real politician, she always gets her own way by managing everyone.» What does this suggest? | She works in a town hall | *She is clever at getting what she wants by managing people | She has lots of pets | She is a very good cook
test: Who are elected politicians chosen by? | The newspaper editors | Their own families | Their teachers | *The people who vote
test: In «many have social media teams who make memes and videos for them», what do the teams do? | They cook dinner for politicians | *They make memes and videos for the politicians | They count the sheep | They run the trains
exam: Which word means a person elected to run a town or a country? | *Politician | Pilgrim | Juggler | Mechanic
